<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Genesis Health.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Genesis Health.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Boston said it named Genesis Health Ventures as a featured stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- reiterated strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Genesis Health lost 1/4 to 28-1/2 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
